            "block_content": "(1) Time scheduled by the Company for travel via common carrier by the shortest practical route between the Work Locations to and from which the Employee is transferred shall be paid for during the day tour schedule in effect at the Jcb Location from which transferred and, when sleeping accommodations are not provided, between 11:00 P.M. and 7:00 A.M., except when the provisions of Paragraph 5(a)(2) apply.",
